BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Farewell My Concubine (1993) (1993)
DTSTART:20260530T210000Z
DTEND:20260531T001000Z
DTSTAMP:20260530T210000Z
UID:XJSV9lgpuR
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 171 mins (2h51m)\n\nPresented by AMOMENT BOOKS. Far
 ewell My Concubine is a 1993 Chinese epic historical drama film\, directed
  by Chen Kaige. Cannes Film Festival Palme d'Or and FIPRESCI Prize Winner.
  This film is the latest restored uncut 4K version (20 minutes longer tha
 n its original Miramax theatrical release).\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema
 /in-theaters/farewell-my-concubine-uncut-4k-restoration-霸王别姬\n\nEs
 timated start: 14:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Velvet Goldmine (1998)
DTSTART:20260602T013000Z
DTEND:20260602T031500Z
DTSTAMP:20260602T013000Z
UID:BYmIDtKVIl
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 90 mins (1h30m)\n\nSIFF Movie Club It’s been 10 ye
 ars since glam-rock superstar Brian Slade (Jonathan Rhys Myers) faked his 
 own death and vanished from the spotlight. Now\, it’s the job of investi
 gative reporter Arthur Stuart (Christian Bale) to locate this living legen
 d and uncover the truth behind his disappearance.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/
 programs-and-events/siff-movie-club/velvet-goldmine\n\nEstimated start: 18
 :45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fried Green Tomatoes (1991)
DTSTART:20260707T013000Z
DTEND:20260707T035500Z
DTSTAMP:20260707T013000Z
UID:B1RIeZowj3
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 130 mins (2h10m)\n\nSIFF Movie Club Towanda! Amidst 
 her own personality crisis\, a southern housewife meets an outgoing old wo
 man who tells her the story of Idgie Threadgoode and Ruth Jamison\, two yo
 ung women who experienced hardships and love in 1920s Whistle Stop\, Alaba
 ma.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/siff-movie-club/fried-gree
 n-tomatoes\n\nEstimated start: 18:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
